sequenceDiagram
  participant Parent as Parent
  participant Issuer as Mobile App / USSD
  participant TIPS as TIPS
  participant MMS as MMS Webhook
  participant Route as Routing Engine
  participant SF as SchoolFeesModule
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  Note over Parent,DB: Parent uses permanent student Lipa Namba 78000028 for entire course

  Parent->>Issuer: Enter Lipa Namba or scan permanent static QR
  Issuer->>TIPS: Pay amount
  TIPS->>TIPS: Resolve alias to school settlement account
  TIPS->>MMS: Payment webhook with tag 62/05 internal ID 00100014
  MMS->>Route: Validate Damm checksum on internal ID
  Route->>DB: Lookup student_aliases by internal_id_8digit
  Route->>SF: AllocatePayment student_id amount
  SF->>DB: payment_allocation oldest invoice first
  SF->>DB: invoice status PAID or PARTIAL
  SF->>DB: student_balances outstanding update
  MMS->>Parent: SMS amount received and balance
  MMS->>DB: audit trail
